    {
      "v": 8,
      "zh": "所以，我们守这节不可用旧酵，也不可用恶毒（或译：阴毒）、邪恶的酵，只用诚实真正的无酵饼。",
      "en": "So then, let us celebrate the festival, not with the old yeast, the yeast of vice and evil, but with the bread without yeast, the bread of sincerity and truth.[NOTE:1]",
      "notes": [
        "Grk “with the unleavened bread of sincerity and truth.”"
      ],
      "gr": [
        {
          "w": "ὥστε",
